translate russian anna_f477f16f:

    # h "How I’m doing… Well, I’m doing great, as you can see."
    h "Как я держусь... Да прекрасно, как видишь."

# game/script.rpy:1770
translate russian anna_ceae1bbf:

    # h "We’ve signed some lucrative contracts, found some generous sponsors, expanded this place, and even managed to open another bar on the other side of town."
    h "Подписали пару жирных контрактов, нашли щедрых спонсоров, расширили это место и даже открыли ещё один бар на другом конце города."

# game/script.rpy:1772
translate russian anna_cca628ba:

    # h "But on the flip side, my days have become so monotonous that I’m practically dying of boredom. It’s the same routine over and over — sleep, work, sleep, work, SLEEP, WORK…"
