# game/script.rpy:1774
translate russian anna_fbf044c1:

    # h "I’m so fed up with it, you know? HA-HA-HA, the same damn thing for the past ten years, and in all this time, I haven’t managed to find myself a boyfriend, let alone a husband..."
    h "Меня уже тошнит от этого, понимаешь? ХА-ХА-ХА. Десять лет одно и то же, и за всё это время я даже парня себе не нашла, не то что мужа..."

# game/script.rpy:1776
translate russian anna_6823de37:

    # h "While all my friends are married with KIDS, CAN YOU BELIEVE IT? AND THEY KEEP COMING TO ME, MOCKING ME, LAUGHING THAT I HAVEN’T FOUND ANYONE IN ALL THESE YEARS."
