    # sss "Although, I should warn you that most of the information there is somewhat made-up, so don’t take it too seriously."
    sss "Правда, предупреждаю: большая часть информации там выдумана, так что не воспринимай её слишком серьёзно."

# game/script.rpy:464
translate russian tutor_cfe6c730:

    # sss "What else... Oh, right! If you’re big fan of visual novels, you can always check out the recommendations in the settings, there are some new, very promising stories in there."
